<title>UK: Two Brent dates clocked, one kept.</title>
<headline>Two Brent dates clocked, one kept.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of three Brent cargoes turning wet on Monday was kept early by an equity holder, but two traders were clocked with the other two Sept 17-19 loaders, oil traders said.</p>
<p>Esso held onto one cargo before the five o'clock deadline, while two trading houses were clocked with the remaining two cargoes, deferred from Friday.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
